(FMT-21 — a possessive special name resolves inside a slot:
 `{arguments's count}`. Run with no arguments the count is 1, so the
 program name is counted. The manual's own example, LANGUAGE.md:3319.
 Ran: VOX_CORE_PATH=/home/josj/scr/english/vox/coreasm /home/josj/scr/english/vox/target/release/vox probe.vox -o p && ./p
 expected output:
   Arguments: 1
)
Print "Arguments: {arguments's count}".
